# D3-EN-009: Pause and resume the pepsin pH gate
# Simulation candidate; no runtime observations are claimed.
register lv3
add v1 water 100mL @ 37C
add v1 gelatin 0.5g
add v1 HCl 0.001mol
add v1 pepsin 0.05g
wait 10min
inspect
add v1 NaOH 0.001mol
measure v1 ph
wait 10min
inspect
add v1 HCl 0.001mol
measure v1 ph
wait 10min
inspect
